'compare.html':['Compare Services',resourcePage('Choosing your scope','Compare the <em>starting points.</em>','Possible deliverables are agreed in your proposal. These are service distinctions, not fixed packages.',`<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Service scope comparison</caption><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Useful when</th><th>Possible output</th><th>Bring to the brief</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['service-1.html','Content design','You need consistent social visuals','Posts, stories, promotional graphics','Copy, brand references, sizes'],['service-2.html','Carousel production','A message needs a clear sequence','A finished carousel or post','Draft message and reference assets'],['service-3.html','Video editing','You have footage ready to shape','Short-form edits','Footage, duration, references'],['service-4.html','Content planning','You need editorial structure','Pillars and a calendar','Goals, channels, audience'],['service-5.html','Creative concepts','You need a campaign direction','Concepts and moodboards','Brief and production constraints'],['service-6.html','Marketing research','You need competitive context','Competitor advertising analysis','Market and research questions'],['websites.html','Website building','You need a home for your business or work','Agreed pages and handover','Page list, content, features']].map(([href,t,a,b,c])=>`<tr><th><a href="${href}">${t}</a></th><td>${a}</td><td>${b}</td><td>${c}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p class="review-note">Website work is a developing offer. Prices, timing, revisions, editable files, and third-party costs are confirmed separately.</p>${link('guide.html','Help me choose')}`) ],
'privacy.html':['Privacy Notice',resourcePage('Enquiries & feedback','Your information,<br><em>handled with care.</em>','This notice describes how the current portfolio handles the information you choose to submit.',`<article class="prose"><h2>What is collected</h2><p>Enquiries include your name, email, enquiry type, service, brief, and any optional budget, deadline, or calculator estimate. Feedback includes the fields you submit and your publication permissions. A submission reference, status, and timestamp are stored with each record.</p><h2>Where it goes</h2><p>Submitted enquiries and feedback are stored in the website’s Cloudflare R2 storage through Sites hosting. Sarah reviews them in management inboxes protected by the current private site access. Submitting the form does not open an email app or automatically subscribe you to a mailing list.</p><h2>What may be published</h2><p>Feedback is unpublished by default. It can appear on the site only after approval and permission to quote it. Name and organisation are displayed only with their separate permissions. Email addresses and project details are excluded from the feedback gallery. Previously published community reflections are attributed on the feedback page.</p><h2>Browser storage</h2><p>Draft rates, calculator selections, and language preference use browser storage. A calculator handoff and your latest enquiry confirmation use session storage in the current tab. You can clear confirmation details on that page, reset the calculator, or clear your browser’s site data. Clearing browser data does not remove submitted records.</p><h2>Removal and corrections</h2><p>Contact Sarah with your submission reference to request a correction, withdrawal of feedback permission, or removal. Include enough information to identify your submission; do not send sensitive documents. No fixed retention period or response time has been finalized.</p><h2>Other services</h2><p>The website uses Google Fonts. External links, including LinkedIn, use their own privacy practices. Hosting and access services may process technical request data under their own policies.</p><div class="actions">${link('contact.html?type=general&topic=privacy','Request a correction or removal')}</div></article>`) ],
'approach.html':['My Approach',resourcePage('The thinking behind the work','Considered ideas.<br><em>Useful execution.</em>','I work across marketing, creative production, research, and writing. My approach connects a clear message with the format that helps it reach people.',`<div class="resource-grid">${[['Start with context','Audience, objective, and constraints give the work a direction before production begins.'],['Make the message clear','Structure, readable layouts, and considered words help an idea become something people can use.'],['Connect thinking and making','Research and concepts inform the content, rather than sitting separately from it.'],['Review with purpose','Consolidated feedback keeps revisions focused on the agreed brief.']].map(([t,d])=>`<article class="resource-card"><h2>${t}</h2><p>${d}</p></article>`).join('')}</div><p class="lead">Independent publishing through Thy Academia, The Sae Talk, and long-form writing sits alongside my marketing and creative experience.</p><div class="actions">${link('work.html','Explore the work')}${link('experience.html','Read my experience')}</div>`) ],
'availability.html':['Project Availability',resourcePage('Projects, roles & partnerships','Let’s discuss<br><em>what comes next.</em>','Availability and start dates are confirmed directly. No open booking slots or response times are promised here.',resourceCards([['contact.html?type=project','Freelance projects',availability.freelance],['contact.html?type=recruiter','Employment opportunities',availability.roles],['collaborate.html','Creative collaborations','Ask about podcast, editorial, and partnership ideas.']])+`<p class="review-note">For a useful first conversation, include the scope, preferred dates, and any deadline constraints.</p>${link('checklist.html','Prepare your enquiry')}`) ],
