 'transformations.html':['Before & After',resourcePage('Illustrative editing exercise','A clearer message,<br><em>step by step.</em>','These personal examples show editing and structure choices. They are fictional demonstrations, with no client attribution or performance claim.',`<span class="pill">Personal concepts / Illustrative only</span><article class="resource-card"><h2>From vague copy to a clear invitation</h2><div class="before-after"><div><h3>Before</h3><blockquote>We have lots of great books and things for everyone. Come and see what we offer.</blockquote></div><div><h3>After</h3><blockquote>Find your next chapter. Browse thoughtful picks and make time for a quiet read.</blockquote></div></div><p>Editing choices: a specific action, a recognisable experience, and a shorter message.</p></article><article class="resource-card"><h2>From a crowded post to a readable sequence</h2><div class="before-after"><div><h3>Before</h3><p>One post combines the event introduction, agenda, visiting directions, and booking instructions.</p></div><div><h3>After</h3><ol><li>Introduce the event and its purpose.</li><li>Explain what to expect.</li><li>Give the place and time.</li><li>Finish with one booking action.</li></ol></div></div><p>Structure choices: one job per slide and a clear next step.</p></article>${link('samples.html','Explore the companion samples')}`) ],
